    {
      "id": "p0012-b004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "In Legends of Localization Book 2, we looked at how the classic game EarthBound was translated into English. Luckily, through personal connections and friendships, I was able to ask the game's creator and the game's head localizer a handful of questions. Given that EarthBound was twenty years old by then, I was thankful to receive any kind of inside information at all.",
        "raw": "In Legends ofL ocalization Book 2,\nwe looked at how the classic game\nEarthBound was translated into\nEnglish. Luckily, through personal\nconnections and friendships, I was\nable to ask the game's creator and\nthe game's head localizer a handful\nof questions. Given that EarthBound\nwas twenty years old by then, I was\nthankful to receive any kind of inside\ninformation at all.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.60407444,
          0.36485,
          0.88835246,
          0.55912143
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.60276528,
          0.36413571,
          0.88966162,
          0.56019286
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          33,
          36,
          38,
          40,
          42,
          44,
          46,
          47,
          48,
          49,
          50
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "在第2卷，我们研究了经典游戏 EarthBound 如何译成英语。幸运的是，通过私人关系和朋友帮忙，我得以向游戏创作者和本地化负责人提几个问题。那时 EarthBound 已问世二十年，能得到任何内部信息，我都十分感激。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": [
          {
