    {
      "id": "p0012-b005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Now, in Book 3, we'll see how Undertale was translated into Japanese. But this time, I have an unparalleled amount of inside access. I've been friends with the game's creator for years, and I've worked alongside the translation staff in the past. I was even brought on as a consultant during the game's Japanese translation. In other words, I can share firsthand and secondhand knowledge about Undertale's translation process, as well as details about the original game itself that have never seen the light of day.",
        "raw": "Now, in Book 3, we'll see how Undertale was translated into Japanese. But this\ntime, I have an unparalleled amount of inside access. I've been friends with\nthe game's creator for years, and I've worked alongside the translation staff\nin the past. I was even brought on as a consultant during the game's Japanese\ntranslation. In other words, I can share firsthand and secondhand knowledge\nabout Underta/e's translation process, as well as details about the original game\nitself that have never seen the light of day.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.29098493,
          0.5743,
          0.89277338,
          0.69797143
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.28607056,
          0.57358571,
          0.89478747,
          0.69904286
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          51,
          52,
          53,
          54,
          55,
          56,
          57
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "如今到了第3卷，我们将看看 Undertale 如何译成日语。这次，我能接触到前所未有的内部资料。我与游戏创作者相识多年，也曾与翻译人员共事；游戏翻译成日语时，我还受邀担任顾问。也就是说，我可以分享 Undertale 翻译过程的一手、二手信息，以及原版游戏中从未公开过的细节。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": [
